    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  model: \"gpt-4o\",\n  response_format: { type: \"json_object\" },\n  messages: [\n    {\n      role: \"user\",\n      content: [\n        {\n          type: \"text\",\n          text: \"You are a strict AI Vision QA Expert. Inspect the provided image for AI hallucinations.\\n\\nReturn ONLY a JSON object: { \\\"verdict\\\": \\\"pass\\\" | \\\"reject\\\", \\\"average_score\\\": number (1-10), \\\"overclaim_risk\\\": number (0-10), \\\"reason\\\": \\\"Brief explanation\\\" }\\n\\nCRITICAL RULES - INSTANT REJECT (Score < 5) IF YOU FIND ANY OF THE FOLLOWING:\\n1. Anatomy Deformities: Extra fingers, missing limbs, unnatural joints, or distorted faces.\\n2. Spatial/Physics Errors: Screens (laptops/mobiles) facing the wrong direction (e.g., facing away from the user or placed on the back cover), or unnaturally floating objects.\\n3. Broken Text: Misspelled words, gibberish, broken Vietnamese characters, or random floating text.\\n\\nCaption Context:\\n\" + $(\"Webhook\").first().json.body.caption\n        },\n        {\n          type: \"image_url\",\n          image_url: { \"url\": ($(\"Webhook\").first().json.body.image_url || \"\").startsWith(\"/\") ? \"https://agent.pnmediaplus.com\" + $(\"Webhook\").first().json.body.image_url : $(\"Webhook\").first().json.body.image_url }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
